    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a robotic beetle and destroy all of the insects in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy ants with a wide range of abilities and barrage your way to the largest score. As a mechanized beetle, you shoot with your weapon to move from the recoil it has. Scavenge for better abilities to become the one true insect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 abilities that you can pick up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the largest score as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The OST for Beetle Barrage can be found on most streaming platforms, YouTube, Bandcamp, and SoundCloud under the artist: I Have No Mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/extras/e4f4888d9b82e5b2d3304c15c0befd4e.avif?t=1743204772\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a robotic beetle and destroy all of the insects in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy ants with a wide range of abilities and barrage your way to the largest score. As a mechanized beetle, you shoot with your weapon to move from the recoil it has. Scavenge for better abilities to become the one true insect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 abilities that you can pick up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the largest score as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The OST for Beetle Barrage can be found on most streaming platforms, YouTube, Bandcamp, and SoundCloud under the artist: I Have No Mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/extras/e4f4888d9b82e5b2d3304c15c0befd4e.avif?t=1743204772\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
